  - m_Id: 299941867020356
    m_Localized: "{0} have arrived at the caf\xE9"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397792030744576
    m_Localized: A new page in Teta's notebook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397792039133184
    m_Localized: Every {0} page in Teta's notebook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397792039133185
    m_Localized: "On a roll \xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397792039133186
    m_Localized: "On a roll \xD7{0} \xB7 +{1} coins"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397792039133187
    m_Localized: "Special order \xB7 {0} coins"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397792039133188
    m_Localized: Teta's kitchen notebook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 397792039133189
    m_Localized: '{0} of {1} pages'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969734352896
    m_Localized: Take your time, my girl. Good things come slowly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547200
    m_Localized: Make it the way your Teta did. I'll wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547201
    m_Localized: The window and I wait together. What have you got today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547202
    m_Localized: Bless you, my girl. Just like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547203
    m_Localized: Bless your hands, Khalil's girl. There's something of your Teta's
      in them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547204
    m_Localized: "The first time I sat here was in '74\u2026 and this is the same
      taste."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547205
    m_Localized: Quick, darling! I've got ten errands and a groom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547206
    m_Localized: On my children's lives, I need something to make me look good in
      front of the neighbours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547207
    m_Localized: "My husband in Dubai calls every day\u2026 almost. Go on, spoil
      me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547208
    m_Localized: Look at you! You take after your Khalto Samira.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547209
    m_Localized: Your Teta used to hush me with a bite. And you? Same trick!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547210
    m_Localized: Bless your hands. Now I'll tell the whole street I taught you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547211
    m_Localized: Something quick, boss. The wood won't wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547212
    m_Localized: The counter says hello. And I'm hungry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547213
    m_Localized: 'The Hajjeh used to say: work on an empty stomach never turns out
      right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547214
    m_Localized: Bless your hands. Solid work, like oak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547215
    m_Localized: That's what gets a man back to work. God give you strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547216
    m_Localized: My master, God rest him, used to say the Hajjeh's hands were blessed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547217
    m_Localized: I want it just right. Don't rush it and ruin it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547218
    m_Localized: Five-minute break. What have you got that's worth it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547219
    m_Localized: In Riyadh we do it differently. But go on, show me your way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547220
    m_Localized: Good. You didn't get it wrong this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547221
    m_Localized: "Not bad\u2026 don't tell anyone I said so."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547222
    m_Localized: My mum does it exactly like this. She never told me where she learned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547223
    m_Localized: I need something to wake me up. It's chemistry till late tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547224
    m_Localized: Is the quiet corner free? Home is a shouting party today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547225
    m_Localized: If I finish this chapter, I deserve a treat, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547226
    m_Localized: Thanks! Now I can learn the whole periodic table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547227
    m_Localized: You're kinder than all my teachers. Tastier too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547228
    m_Localized: When I pass, you're the first person I'll tell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547229
    m_Localized: Something small for Rami. He's waiting for me at home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547230
    m_Localized: All day I cook for other people. Today I want someone to cook for
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547231
    m_Localized: Quick, love, my pot's on the stove!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547232
    m_Localized: God keep those hands of yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547233
    m_Localized: 'Rami will ask where it''s from. I''ll tell him: from our lovely
      neighbours.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547234
    m_Localized: Abu Rami loved this smell, God rest him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547235
    m_Localized: On shift till morning. Something warm, bless you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547236
    m_Localized: "I need something to keep me going, or I'll fall asleep on a patient.
      Kidding\u2026 half kidding."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547237
    m_Localized: I left the hospital, and your light's still on. Thank God.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547238
    m_Localized: Best medicine of the night. No prescription comes close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547239
    m_Localized: Thank you. The night gets shorter when someone's awake with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547240
    m_Localized: "My family's asleep, the hospital's awake\u2026 and you're here.
      Thank you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547241
    m_Localized: I'll play you a song instead of paying. Deal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547242
    m_Localized: My fingers are tired from the strings. Something good, and you get
      my best tune.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547243
    m_Localized: There are only a few coins in my case. Enough for something small?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547244
    m_Localized: Thanks! That's worth a whole song.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547245
    m_Localized: "A new tune just came to me. I'll name it after the caf\xE9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547246
    m_Localized: My grandpa used to say a hungry musician plays out of tune. Thanks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547247
    m_Localized: 'Sara: One thing, and we''ll share. Noor: No, two!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547248
    m_Localized: 'Noor: My treat today. Sara: So, my treat, then.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547249
    m_Localized: 'Sara: Something cheap. We''re still saving for the sofa.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547250
    m_Localized: 'Noor: Honestly, better than our wedding dinner.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547251
    m_Localized: 'Sara: See? Money well spent. Noor: Fine, you win.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547252
    m_Localized: 'Noor: Every time we disagree, we come here. And we always make
      up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547253
    m_Localized: Between one letter and the next, something quick, my girl.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547254
    m_Localized: My bag's heavy today. People still write, thank God.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547255
    m_Localized: "Every time I pass by, I remember something\u2026 never mind. What
      have you got?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547256
    m_Localized: Bless your hands. Now I'll deliver the post with a smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547257
    m_Localized: My whole life delivering letters, and this is the best one I've
      ever got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547258
    m_Localized: Bless you. Some things should have reached this place long ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547259
    m_Localized: 'Calmly, dear, like dictation: one letter at a time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547260
    m_Localized: "How's Rana? Give her my love\u2026 and what have you got today?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547261
    m_Localized: Thirty years in a classroom, and my coffee never once stayed hot.
      Go on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547262
    m_Localized: Ten out of ten. And a gold star.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547263
    m_Localized: Clever like your mum. She always handed her homework in on time
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547264
    m_Localized: If only Rana were here to see you. She'd be so proud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547265
    m_Localized: Something quick, please. I've got a call in ten minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547266
    m_Localized: Let's see today's quality. Surprise me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547267
    m_Localized: Just running a little benchmark. Your pick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547268
    m_Localized: Perfect. That's not an order, that's an experience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547269
    m_Localized: Very nice. You've got the details spot on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547270
    m_Localized: "This taste reminds me of something\u2026 no, nothing. Thanks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547271
    m_Localized: By the window, please. That way I can see the street.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547272
    m_Localized: What have you got today? I want the taste of Amman, like the old
      days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547273
    m_Localized: "Fifty years in Jeddah\u2026 and now I'm back, remembering."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547274
    m_Localized: Bless your hands, dear. Really lovely!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547275
    m_Localized: That's how Amman was when I was young. Exactly like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547276
    m_Localized: Some people go away, and the taste stays behind, waiting for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547277
    m_Localized: Hi! Something nice before I head back to work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547278
    m_Localized: The neighbours told me about you. Let me try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547279
    m_Localized: My parents used to bring me here years ago. I want that same taste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547280
    m_Localized: "Long day\u2026 something to bring me back to life, please."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547281
    m_Localized: No rush. Sitting here is good for the heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547282
    m_Localized: Make me whatever you like. I trust you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547283
    m_Localized: Bless your hands! I haven't tasted anything like this in ages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547284
    m_Localized: Thank you so much. Next time I'll bring my family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547285
    m_Localized: You've taken me right back to the old days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547286
    m_Localized: That makes the whole visit. Bless you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547287
    m_Localized: "Delicious! The neighbourhood was missing a caf\xE9 like this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547288
    m_Localized: Thank you. It's the first time I've felt I'm not alone in this city.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547289
    m_Localized: A green bean has no smell yet. Every good thing starts out like
      that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547290
    m_Localized: "My first roast, in '74, half of it burned. Nobody knew\u2026 except
      Samira's mother."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547291
    m_Localized: A handful for every guest, and one more. There's always another
      guest on the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547292
    m_Localized: Grind it as fine as flour. Abu Fadi can tell from the first sip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547293
    m_Localized: Cardamom goes in last, and its scent arrives first. Like my little
      Cardamom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547294
    m_Localized: The first cup, in '74, went to Mr. Fadi. He asked for a smile as
      well, God forgive him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547295
    m_Localized: The little dallah is mine alone. Except for two little girls, with
      my hand over theirs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547296
    m_Localized: 'My copper dallah: he asked ten, I paid four. Abu Fadi says six.
      He''s wrong.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547297
    m_Localized: Carry the tray with both hands, and set it down before the eldest
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547298
    m_Localized: Hospitality is coffee, sweets and a smiling face. The face matters
      most.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547299
    m_Localized: Got this far, my heart? The coffee is yours now, and its name is
      waiting for my children.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547300
    m_Localized: Coarse semolina for ma'amoul, fine for basbousa. Mix them up once
      and you'll learn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547301
    m_Localized: 'Flour sticks to everything: hands, hair and little girls. That''s
      the best part.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547302
    m_Localized: 'Dough needs an hour''s rest. Like us: when it''s tired, it hardens.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547303
    m_Localized: Each ball the size of a walnut. And Samira ate one in every three.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547304
    m_Localized: The round mould for dates, the long one for walnuts, the domed one
      for pistachios. Don't mix them up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547305
    m_Localized: The plate goes to the neighbours before us. Whoever gives first
      eats best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547306
    m_Localized: A box of ma'amoul travels. Put in one extra, for the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547307
    m_Localized: The edge piece is only for the good ones. I tell them so, and they
      turn out good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547308
    m_Localized: The tray turns on the fire, the way the world turns. The recipe?
      Somewhere safer than here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547309
    m_Localized: 'An Eid tray needs many hands: neighbours, girls, and someone stealing
      the walnuts.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547310
    m_Localized: If you've come this far, the sweets are in your hands. But the sweetest
      thing? Everyone home for Eid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547311
    m_Localized: Mint in summer, sage in winter. Whoever fights over them goes without.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547312
    m_Localized: Keep mint in a glass of water like flowers, and it stays fresh a
      week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547313
    m_Localized: Loose tea needs a tight tin. Once the scent gets out, it doesn't
      come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547314
    m_Localized: 'A glass of tea and a seat on the doorstep: that''s how every quarrel
      on the street used to end.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547315
    m_Localized: Tea has to steep slowly. Rush it, and you'll drink it bitter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547316
    m_Localized: Mint for Nawal, sage for Rana. And I drink from both pots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547317
    m_Localized: A tea tray gathers the ones who are sulking. A glass in every hand,
      and the talk starts to flow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547318
    m_Localized: Afternoon tea on the doorstep with the neighbours. That's where
      the whole street's problems get solved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547319
    m_Localized: Finished the tea? Now make two pots, my love, so nobody's upset.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547320
    m_Localized: Saffron is as dear as gold. Just two threads; keep the rest for
      Eid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547321
    m_Localized: Cardamom, lots and lots. Riyadh people are generous, and you can
      taste it in the cardamom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547322
    m_Localized: 'The first time I saw it, I said: that''s tea! Then I drank three
      cups.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547323
    m_Localized: The cup is small, and you shake it when you've had enough. I never
      once shook mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547324
    m_Localized: This dallah was a gift from the groom's family at Nawal's wedding.
      The dallah stayed here. Nawal went.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547325
    m_Localized: Dates before coffee. Anyone who asks why gets two dates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547326
    m_Localized: 'A tray from Riyadh and a cup from Amman: that''s how I made Nawal''s
      wedding coffee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547327
    m_Localized: A majlis has no head. Whoever sits in it becomes family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547328
    m_Localized: Now you have two coffees, my heart. And one heart has room for both.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547329
    m_Localized: Milk boils over the moment you look away. Like Rana when she was
      little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547330
    m_Localized: Labneh drains for a whole night. Good things need a night; the morning
      shows them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547331
    m_Localized: White cheese keeps a year in brine. A grudge keeps longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547332
    m_Localized: Nabulsi cheese sleeps in water overnight. The salt leaves, and the
      good stays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547333
    m_Localized: A cheese plate needs olives, mint and warm bread. The rest is just
      talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547334
    m_Localized: An Arab breakfast never ends. You get up, and someone sits down
      in your place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547335
    m_Localized: 'Abu Fadi''s Friday tray: labneh and za''atar. And nobody asks him
      why he''s quiet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547336
    m_Localized: The Friday table needs every chair. If one is empty, put a cup in
      front of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547337
    m_Localized: Fridays were for everyone. Bring them back, my love, one by one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547338
    m_Localized: Just a handful of beans to smell, my girl. It's been so long since
      I smelled her coffee.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547339
    m_Localized: "That smell\u2026 every morning she woke the whole street with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547340
    m_Localized: The neighbours are looking out of their windows. Treat them, my
      girl. It's on me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547341
    m_Localized: Tomorrow they'll be back, and they'll bring others. That's how your
      Teta started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547342
    m_Localized: Tomorrow at five! I need sweets that do us proud, and coffee made
      properly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547343
    m_Localized: That's it! If the groom doesn't fall for you, he'll fall for the
      ma'amoul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547344
    m_Localized: Your Teta used to hush me with ma'amoul. Bring two. I'm loud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547345
    m_Localized: "There, I'm quiet. For one minute\u2026 for her sake."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547346
    m_Localized: 'Two glasses of tea: one for me, and one to prove I''m right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547347
    m_Localized: See? It's better with mint. Don't say a word, your face already
      did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547348
    m_Localized: "Cardamom and Sugar\u2026 bring me the two of them on one tray."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547349
    m_Localized: 'That''s how your Teta wanted you two: on one tray.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547350
    m_Localized: You said my plate and cup are on you? Fine. Wood works better on
      a full stomach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547351
    m_Localized: The Hajjeh fed me just like this, back when I was my master's apprentice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547352
    m_Localized: One cup, from the little dallah. And don't ask why.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547353
    m_Localized: "Her hand was warm over mine\u2026 that's all. Not a word."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547354
    m_Localized: A cup from Jeddah and a cup from Amman. I belong to both, dear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547355
    m_Localized: "Yes, just like that. Both tastes in one heart\u2026 like long ago."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547356
    m_Localized: "My mum asked about the caf\xE9. Make a dallah with dates. I want
      to send her a photo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547357
    m_Localized: "She saw it and wrote: \u2018Bless your hands, both of you.\u2019
      Both of us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547358
    m_Localized: The boxes are upstairs, and so is the oud. A pot of tea for me and
      Karim?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547359
    m_Localized: For this tea, I'll play you the whole staircase, step by step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547360
    m_Localized: Basil doesn't arrive on its own, my girl. Put an extra cup on the
      tray.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547361
    m_Localized: Leave the extra cup out. Tomorrow or the day after, someone will
      come to drink it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547362
    m_Localized: I gave you a taste of my kitchen. Now give me a taste of yours.
      And ma'amoul for Rami.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547363
    m_Localized: Since Abu Rami passed, nobody has cooked for me. Bless your hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547364
    m_Localized: Today I'm not just dropping off the post and leaving. Bring me a
      whole pot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547365
    m_Localized: Your Teta used to pour for me like this, and I was always in a hurry.
      Not anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547366
    m_Localized: Roof's done? Breakfast is on me. A tray for the master and his crew,
      please.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547367
    m_Localized: "Perfect. That's how the trays used to come out back then\u2026
      I imagine, I mean."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547368
    m_Localized: Teta made a deal? Make a tea tray. It's going to be a long night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547369
    m_Localized: Fine. What we don't understand, we don't sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547370
    m_Localized: 'I told you: two cups, and come to the window. I''m ready.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547371
    m_Localized: Sit down, girls. I've waited twenty years for these two cups.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547372
    m_Localized: "Mum didn't answer. Make a dallah her way\u2026 maybe the smell
      will reach her."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547373
    m_Localized: "It smells like our house in Riyadh. Okay\u2026 now I can keep going."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547374
    m_Localized: I matched them, so the gift is mine! A box of ma'amoul for the bride,
      and two cups.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547375
    m_Localized: Look at the bride smile! My mum smiled just like that on her wedding
      day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547376
    m_Localized: A plate of ma'amoul for the family table. Your Teta used it to make
      peace between them when they were little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 399969738547377
    m_Localized: I put it in the middle of the table. The rest is up to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 409733914681344
    m_Localized: "Caf\xE9 floor"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 409733923069952
    m_Localized: Kitchen corner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 409733923069953
    m_Localized: Rooftop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 409733923069954
    m_Localized: "A new space in the caf\xE9: {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 416373887983616
    m_Localized: Hebron plates
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 416373892177920
    m_Localized: Family photos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 416373892177921
    m_Localized: Wall clock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 416373892177922
    m_Localized: Arched mirror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 416373892177923
    m_Localized: Sadu weaving
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 416373892177924
    m_Localized: Finjan shelf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
